               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N2032C">34 x 25.6</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N2032F">3 bifolios. Written in brown ink. Paper: 14 staves. First and last page blank. Contains following songs: "N<rend xml:id="idm59" rend="sup">o.</rend> 20 Udfrielsen af Ægypten" (HartW 376); "N<rend xml:id="idm60" rend="sup">o.</rend> 22 Lovgivningen paa Sinai" (HartW 388); "N<rend xml:id="idm61" rend="sup">o.</rend> 33 David og Goliath" (HartW 391); "N<rend xml:id="idm62" rend="sup">o.</rend> 34 Davids Seiers-Sang"; "N<rend xml:id="idm63" rend="sup">o.</rend> 57 Johannes den Døber" (HartW 377); "N<rend xml:id="idm64" rend="sup">o.</rend> 59 Herrens Fristelse" (HartW 385); "N<rend xml:id="idm65" rend="sup">o.</rend> 69 Jairi Datter" (HartW 379); "N<rend xml:id="idm66" rend="sup">o.</rend> 93 Kammersvenden fra Morland" (HartW 381); and "N<rend xml:id="idm67" rend="sup">o.</rend> 64. Peders Apostel-Kald" (HartW 378). Contrary to Hartmann's habit, the texts are written in Latin script.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
